-- The World of Tomorrow (the book's Area 2 map, 8A), redrawn in our pieces. Turned half round from
-- the book's page, like the Hunting Grounds, so its door from the hall is on the west. The book's
-- room is small and holds one thing: the steam mech in the middle. Blown up to fill the mat, with
-- the dais it stands on, the neon lamps and a few cases of tomorrow's wonders from the book's words.
-- The south wall is left off.

